      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's a good start in terms of getting the words in there, but I'm worried about the actual readability. If a human reviewer sees this, they might think it looks a bit forced. \n\nCan you try to expand this into a full, detailed technical subsection? I need it to be more substantial—maybe 3 or 4 paragraphs—covering the lifecycle and maintenance aspects too. \n\nJust a heads up: please don't just keyword-stuff or make it a list of terms. I need it to be a coherent, professional proposal that a real engineer would respect, while still making sure we hit that 0.8 score. We really need to find that balance so we pass the bot but don't look ridiculous to the humans.",
